  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Public Expenditure Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ministry of Finance of the Kingdom of Swaziland requested for a public expenditure review. The project seeks to strengthen  public expenditure management in the Swaziland Ministry of Finance to improve capacity for better budgeting reporting and audit control. The development objective of this grant is to strengthen institutional capacity for better budgeting, reporting, and audit controls in Swaziland&apos;s Ministry of Finance and Ministry of Economic Planning and Development. The likely outcomes of this grant are:1) a realistic budgetary macroeconomic framework; 2) improved budget reporting system to increase public awareness and transparency of the budget and 3) internal and external audit systems that enable the timely assessment of the overall quality of the financial control systems.</narrative>
  </description>
